{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"solarized-day","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Solarized Day","description":"Solarized light, warm paper colors.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Solarized Day","path":"themes/solarized-day.json","uiTheme":"light"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/solarized-day.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Solarized Day\",\n  \"type\": \"light\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#fdf6e3\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#657b83\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#eee8d5\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#e6dfc8\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#e6dfc8\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#eee8d5\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#e6dfc8\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#eee8d5\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#fdf6e3\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#eee8d5\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#ddd6c1\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#268bd2\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#268bd2\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#268bd2\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#eee8d5\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#e6dfc880\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#268bd2\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#ddd6c1\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#dc322f\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#859900\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#b58900\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#dc322f\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#93a1a1\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#2aa198\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#d33682\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#859900\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#b58900\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#268bd2\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#cb4b16\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#586e75\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#268bd2\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#b58900\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#cb4b16\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Solarized Day\n\nSolarized light, warm paper colors.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Solarized Day** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a light theme.\n\nColors from the Solarized palette by Ethan Schoonover (MIT).\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#fdf6e3` |\n| Text | `#657b83` |\n| Accent | `#268bd2` |\n| Keywords | `#859900` |\n| Strings | `#2aa198` |\n| Functions | `#268bd2` |\n| Types | `#b58900` |\n| Comments | `#93a1a1` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}